{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2020","id":1978297972,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz88516m50","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2020","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2020.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2020.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2020","number":2020,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Redo OIDC configuration","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"[thoughts](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1X85PMxIaVWDF6T_UPji3OeeUqVBcGj_uHRM5CI-AwlY)\r\n\r\nCopy of Changelog:\r\n\r\n- Remove `dns.use_username_in_magic_dns` configuration option [#2020](https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2020)\r\n  - Having usernames in magic DNS is no longer possible.\r\n- Redo OpenID Connect configuration [#2020](https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2020)\r\n  - `strip_email_domain` has been removed, domain is _always_ part of the username for OIDC.\r\n  - Users are now identified by `sub` claim in the ID token instead of username, allowing the username, name and email to be updated.\r\n  - User has been extended to store username, display name, profile picture url and email.\r\n    - These fields are forwarded to the client, and shows up nicely in the user switcher.\r\n    - These fields can be made available via the API/CLI for non-OIDC users in the future.\r\n\r\n\r\nRelated issues:\r\n\r\nCloses #1990 \r\nCloses #1980\r\nCloses #1981\r\nCloses #1997\r\nCloses #1594\r\nCloses #938\r\n\r\nThese are closed as we will not support custom features outside of the OIDC standard.\r\nCloses #1858 \r\nCloses #1934\r\n\r\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\r\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\r\n\r\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\r\n\r\n- **New Features**\r\n\t- Enhanced user management with additional fields for display names, email addresses, and profile pictures.\r\n\t- Significant updates to OpenID Connect configuration, including the removal of `strip_email_domain` and a shift to using the `sub` claim for user identification.\r\n\r\n- **Bug Fixes**\r\n\t- Improved error handling throughout authentication and user management processes.\r\n\r\n- **Refactor**\r\n\t- Simplified authentication mechanisms by introducing an `AuthProvider` interface.\r\n\t- Streamlined user identification methods and removed deprecated configurations for clarity.\r\n\t- Adjusted DNS configuration handling by eliminating the use of usernames in MagicDNS.\r\n\r\n- **Documentation**\r\n\t- Updated `CHANGELOG.md` to reflect changes in configuration and user identification mechanisms.\r\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->","created_at":"2024-07-19T15:49:48Z","updated_at":"2024-11-05T15:55:30Z","closed_at":"2024-10-02T12:50:18Z","merged_at":"2024-10-02T12:50:18Z","merge_commit_sha":"218138afeec7fbd82f84334ab049c43736c8d489","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"ohdearaugustin","id":14001491,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDAxNDkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.co